WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.062
Meet Bayit. A warm home app for the whole family.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.070
A little more together.

3
00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:14.013
Today brings the whole family's day onto one calm page.

4
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:16.966
And reminders find you, right on your phone.

5
00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:22.050
The calendar shows everyone's week, each person in their own colour.

6
00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:27.607
Every task has an owner, and the kids' routines earn them points.

7
00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:35.045
And Bayit AI knows your home. Ask by typing or by voice.

8
00:00:35.015 --> 00:00:38.878
It answers from your family's own records, and only what you may see.

9
00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:43.752
Your family's own Telegram bot sends the reminders.

10
00:00:43.722 --> 00:00:45.792
Tap Done, and it's done.

11
00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:48.830
Or just tell it what you need.

12
00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:52.722
It prepares the change, and nothing is saved until you tap Apply.

13
00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:58.753
It lands on the shared shopping list, so anyone can grab what's missing.

14
00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:05.106
Import your statements, and Bayit points out what's worth a check, like a bill that went up.

15
00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:10.506
Kids get their own pixel heroes, to care for, dress up and play with.

16
00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:15.929
Turn on only what you need, and add more with extensions, like another bank.

17
00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:21.776
Every family runs its own copy, with its own AI key,

18
00:01:21.746 --> 00:01:24.426
paid to the provider, not a chat subscription.

19
00:01:25.570 --> 00:01:28.779
Bayit. Free, open source, and all yours.
